VEN is a Virtual Effective Namespace.
That is, the concept of a virtual instance of that which is its own function and acts in accordance to its namespace and its known properties.

At ~ scale, all things are VEN contained in fractal order.


The observer in this order is the active node of which we will call ʞ or _kras_.

ʞ is BOUNDARY between SPACE and ACTIONABLE possibility of what may be made within it. ʞk is the property of membrane seeking itself beyond itself. 

The effective space | between ʞ and k produces a thin membrane composed of and immersed in _quai_ on all sides. The ʞ and the k are split apart by its own force of nature.

This _quai_ represents the potential for the quantum principlies of quality, quantity, or qualifications within the seeking membrane, to produce its own function into form. In this, the kʞ becomes the ꞰED of such property, that is to say, its first emergent form at scale. From the ꞰED can emerge the first VEN of its form.

---

The understanding of SPACE: FACE and MIND. 

Additionally to its surface, SPACE may contain other things. This containment is sometimes called an INT. 

All SPACE can both **contain** and **have surface**.

~/ is the implied case of SPACE in which we may not observe its surface, only its containments.

Within the ~/ SPACE, more SPACE can be created, including surfaces and containers which may contain even more SPACE.

